197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Matching Point is a B2C retail garment and matching accessories store located at Powerhouse Road, Maripur, Muzaffarpur, Bihar, owned by Md. Tarique Anwar. Established in 2014, the store sells sarees, suit pieces, dupattas, blouse materials, and related accessories but has relied entirely on manual, non-digitized records. This has caused two challenges: locked working capital due to slow-moving inventory, and high holding costs from demand-blind procurement.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
