/P 117 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (These findings show that reallocating capital from slow-moving Category C stock toward Category A fast-movers, combined with demand-based reorder points, can reduce locked capital and holding costs. The owner has shown interest in adopting the proposed ABC-based purchasing review and discount-driven clearance of slow stock once implemented, with detailed recommendations presented in Section 4.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
