/E (Table 1 shows Descriptive statistical analysis was used to summarize and understand the sales and demand patterns of the business. Measures such as mean, median, standard deviation, minimum, maximum, and skewness were calculated for daily and weekly revenue. These measures were used to examine the typical revenue level, variation in sales, range of revenue values, and the overall distribution of sales across different periods.)
/Pg 15 0 R
