278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 120 0 R
/E (Descriptive statistics was selected because it provides a clear quantitative summary of the business's sales performance and helps identify variations between different trading periods. Analysing measures such as average revenue and standard deviation helps determine the consistency of sales, while skewness provides an indication of whether sales are influenced by occasional high- or low-revenue periods. This analysis provides a statistical foundation for understanding demand patterns and supports better inventory and procurement planning. This is aligned with the project's objective of minimizing total inventory cost. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
