/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (ABC analysis was selected because the business does not currently use a structured quantitative approach to identify which products contribute most to revenue. The method helps distinguish high-revenue products from relatively low-contribution products and therefore supports prioritization of inventory and working capital. This is directly aligned with the first business problem of reducing locked working capital.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
