/K [11]
>>
endobj
299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (Inventory turnover analysis was selected to identify products or product groups with slower stock movement that may keep working capital tied up in inventory for longer periods. This complements ABC analysis because revenue contribution alone does not indicate how efficiently inventory is moving. Together, the two methods help identify products that require closer inventory attention and support the objective of reducing locked working capital. This rationale is also consistent with the approved project methodology. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
