424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (The 7-day moving average analysis also shows that daily sales fluctuate considerably. The moving average smooths these fluctuations and provides a more stable estimate of underlying demand. At the end of April, the 7-day moving average was approximately 5,669 sales value per day, which can be used as a short-term reference for planning future stock requirements.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (These findings indicate that the business faces two opposite inventory risks: stockouts in high-demand products and excess stock in slower-moving products. Both situations can increase total inventory-related costs.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
