448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (The findings establish that revenue at Matching Point is heavily concentrated: just 3 products \(12.50%\) account for 67.56% of total revenue, while 16 low-contribution products \(66.67% of the range\) generate only 10.14%. Inventory turnover analysis further revealed that categories such as Night Wear, Men's Wear, and Accessories move considerably slower than fast-moving categories like Saree and Suit Piece, indicating where working capital is currently tied up. The 7-day Moving Average provided a smoother basis for near-term procurement decisions than relying on single-day sales figures or owner intuition.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
