/Title (The cumulative revenue line rises rapidly across the first few products and reaches approximately 67.56% after the first three products, confirming that Suit Piece, Saree, and Dupatta together generate more than two-thirds of total revenue. The line then increases more gradually through the Class B products and eventually approaches 100% as the remaining Class C products are included.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 915 0 R
/Next 735 0 R
>>
endobj
854 0 obj
<<
/Title (Therefore, the Pareto analysis supports a prioritized inventory-control approach rather than a uniform stocking strategy. The business can use the results to concentrate monitoring and procurement attention on high-revenue products while periodically reviewing the quantities and movement of lower-contribution products.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 735 0 R
>>
endobj
