/Title (In Figure 1, The Pareto chart provides a visual representation of the concentration of revenue across the 24 products. The bars are arranged in descending order of revenue, with Suit Piece showing the highest revenue contribution, followed by Saree and Dupatta. A sharp decline in the bar heights after the first few products indicates that revenue is concentrated among a limited number of products rather than being evenly distributed across the entire product range.)
