980 0 obj
<<
/Title (Moving average forecasting was used to estimate near-future product demand from historical sales data. The method calculates the average demand over a fixed number of previous periods and uses this value as the forecast for the subsequent period. This helps smooth short-term fluctuations in sales and provides a simple estimate of the expected demand trend.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 973 0 R
>>
endobj
